  <annotations>
    <text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(10, 30, 950, 85)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="15">Offline: select fasting blood sugar &gt; 120 in Box Plot, then click the 1 segment. Purge removes constant/unused domain values; it does not repair missing cells. This EDA selection never feeds model validation.</text>
